    {
      "text": "显示两个连续 TransportAction 的图编辑器画布截图。TransportAction“Transport to Train”有一条连向 PhysicalLocation“Load Terminal #4”的“dropoffLocation”边；TransportAction“Train To Siding 341A”有一条连向“Load Terminal #4”的“pickupLocation”边和一条连向 PhysicalLocation“Siding 341A”的“dropoffLocation”边。每个 TransportAction 各有其自己的 Relationship“hasInput”、“hasOutput”和“performedBy”节点；BulkHardware“Graphite”（金色）由来自这些关系的“to”边指向，并有一条“bulkQuantity”边延伸出视图顶部。“Transport to Train”由 Organization“Safe Trucking LTD”执行，“Train To Siding 341A”由 Organization“KJ Trains LTD”执行。两个“ResponsibilityChange...”节点（截断）带有“previous”、“current”和“responsibilityChangedOn”边；其中一个展开显示“responsibilityCategory*” = “ownership”以及值以“2025-08-27”开头的 actionStartTime 和 actionEndTime 字段。Relationship“isLocatedAt”将 PhysicalLocation“Siding 341A”链接到 Organization“Carbon Graph Inc”。",
